# Test-account credentials. reset_fresh_accounts.sql carries the plaintext
# shared password for four LIVE Supabase accounts; it has never been committed
# (history checked) and must stay that way. A bare `git add .` would have
# staged it. Give any future credential script one of these suffixes so it is
# covered by name rather than relying on someone remembering.
supabase/reset_fresh_accounts.sql
*.local.sql
*.secret.sql

# Claude Code local settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Raw session transcripts — contain live keys and test patient data
docs/chat-history/

# Pre-monorepo sub-repo history backups (safe to delete once the push is verified)
.git-backup/

# Logs
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
screenshots/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately untracked working material. These were merely UNTRACKED until
# the repository was made public on 2026-09-06; untracked is not a boundary —
# one `git add -A` stages the lot. Ignoring them makes that accident impossible.
#
#   .claude/          session hand-off notes. Twelve of them quote the live
#                     test-account password in plain text, next to the four
#                     real account emails — including the admin. Publishing
#                     these would hand out working credentials to a live
#                     system holding real patient records.
#   docs/v2 design/   design-canvas working files, kept out of the repo by
#                     standing instruction. `git add -A docs` swept these in
#                     once already and had to be unstaged.
#   Images/           scratch folder for source images. site/assets holds the
#                     cropped, web-sized copies that actually ship.
#   docs/data/        source documents obtained from the City Health Office.
#                     The Valencia 2024-2025 barangay TB sheet is an internal
#                     office document carrying the City TB Nurse Coordinator's
#                     full name and PRC licence number. The barangay figures
#                     may be quoted in the paper; the file itself is not ours
#                     to republish, and a public repo is republication.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
docs/v2 design/
Images/
docs/data/
